From: VultaV <unc1010@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] ucode: handle the STATUS_BREAK status

ucode 2026-10-18 adds STATUS_BREAK to uc_vm_status_t for debugger break
requests. rpcd never requests a break, but -Werror=switch fails the
build. Treat it like a runtime error.

--- a/ucode.c
+++ b/ucode.c
@@ -1018,6 +1018,7 @@ rpc_ucode_script_execute(struct ubus_con
 		fprintf(stderr, "Compilation error while executing ucode script %s\n", path);
 		break;
 
+	case STATUS_BREAK:
 	case ERROR_RUNTIME:
 		fprintf(stderr, "Runtime error while executing ucode script %s\n", path);
 		break;
